######## 10:43:24 ssm-pe4a: PE4 は SSM の範囲(232/8 を含む)と LAN 側 IGMPv3・RP は全グループ 10.255.0.11。RCV3 を IGMPv3 で (192.168.1.1, 232.1.1.1) に
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
PE4(config)#
ip pim rp-address 10.255.0.11
PE4(config)#
end
PE4#
show running-config | include ip pim|igmp version
 ip pim sparse-mode
 ip pim sparse-mode
 ip pim sparse-mode
 ip igmp version 3
ip pim bidir-enable
ip pim rp-address 10.255.0.11
ip pim rp-address 10.255.0.3 48 bidir
ip pim spt-threshold infinity group-list 17
ip pim rp-candidate Loopback0 group-list 16 priority 200
ip pim ssm range 32
PE4#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
RCV3(config)#
interface Ethernet0/0
RCV3(config-if)#
ip igmp version 3
RCV3(config-if)#
ip igmp join-group 232.1.1.1 source 192.168.1.1
RCV3(config-if)#
end
