######## 10:44:02 ssm-pe4b: PE4 から ip pim ssm を外す(IGMPv3 は残す)。新しいグループ (192.168.1.1, 232.1.1.3)
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
PE4(config)#
no ip pim ssm range 32
PE4(config)#
end
PE4#
show running-config | include ip pim ssm
PE4#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
RCV3(config)#
interface Ethernet0/0
RCV3(config-if)#
ip igmp join-group 232.1.1.3 source 192.168.1.1
RCV3(config-if)#
end
